<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1993432842"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1645267273"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Before I Rise (Acoustic Ver.)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="She is Legend"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Before I Rise (Acoustic Ver.)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:40.999"><div begin="00:25.564" end="05:40.999"><p begin="00:25.564" end="00:29.910" itunes:key="L1">その首に口付け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想亲吻你的脖颈</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ku bi ni ku chi zu ke</span></p><p begin="00:29.911" end="00:33.350" itunes:key="L2">匂いを嗅いでたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">细嗅你散发的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i wo ka i de ta i</span></p><p begin="00:33.351" end="00:41.105" itunes:key="L3">あるいはここで死のうか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我有可能在此死去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru i ha ko ko de shi no u ka</span></p><p begin="00:41.106" end="00:45.085" itunes:key="L4">ある晴れた放課後<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在某个晴朗的放学后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ha re ta ho u ka go</span></p><p begin="00:45.086" end="00:49.458" itunes:key="L5">銃弾が降り注ぎ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">枪林弹雨侵袭而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ju u da n ga fu ri so so gi</span></p><p begin="00:49.459" end="00:54.675" itunes:key="L6">惨劇の季節が来た<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">造就惨剧的季节来临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ge ki no ki se tsu ga ki ta</span></p><p begin="00:56.008" end="00:59.454" itunes:key="L7">風が止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待微风止息后风车也不再旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga to ma 't ta fu u sha mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:59.455" end="01:03.376" itunes:key="L8">風車も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风车也停下了</span></p><p begin="01:03.377" end="01:07.196" itunes:key="L9">ふいごも止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风箱停止运转后声音也随之停下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i go mo to ma 't ta o to mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:07.197" end="01:09.733" itunes:key="L10">音も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音也停下了</span></p><p begin="01:09.734" end="01:13.261" itunes:key="L11">息も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待呼吸停止后心脏也不再跃动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki mo to ma 't ta shi n zo u mo to ma 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:13.262" end="01:17.015" itunes:key="L12">心臓も止まった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳也停下了</span></p><p begin="01:17.016" end="01:25.019" itunes:key="L13">そうしてすべてお仕舞いに出来たら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果能让这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u shi te su be te</span></p><p begin="01:25.417" end="01:28.991" itunes:key="L14">どうかそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托你留在我身边 就连所处的噩梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so ba ni i te ko n na a ku mu mo</span></p><p begin="01:28.992" end="01:39.614" itunes:key="L15">こんな悪夢も狂おしいほど愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是这般噩梦 我也曾近乎痴狂般热爱</span></p><p begin="01:39.615" end="01:43.354" itunes:key="L16">出来れば笑って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可以的话就让我笑着面对 我只希望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki re ba wa ra 't te i ku o ku ko u ne n</span></p><p begin="01:43.355" end="01:47.223" itunes:key="L17">幾億光年<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算过去数亿光年</span></p><p begin="01:47.224" end="01:53.166" itunes:key="L18">いつまでもいられますよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕历经几亿光年依然能与彼此相伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ma de mo i ra re ma su yo u</span></p><p begin="01:53.167" end="01:58.235" itunes:key="L19">お願いしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我诚挚的期愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ne ga i shi ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:07.362" end="02:11.378" itunes:key="L20">すべてを放り出し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抛下所有的束缚之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te wo ho u ri da shi</span></p><p begin="02:11.379" end="02:15.564" itunes:key="L21">子供のようにはしゃぐ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像个孩子般恣意欢闹起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo no yo u ni ha sha gu</span></p><p begin="02:15.565" end="02:22.358" itunes:key="L22">それは許されるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样又能否得到允许呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ha yu ru sa re ru ka na</span></p><p begin="02:22.359" end="02:26.372" itunes:key="L23">そうだ明日は海へ行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如明天一起去看海吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u da a su ha u mi he i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:26.373" end="02:30.832" itunes:key="L24">おもちゃもたくさん持って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着装了满满一箱的玩具</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo cha mo ta ku sa n mo 't te</span></p><p begin="02:30.833" end="02:35.112" itunes:key="L25">きみも一緒にどうかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿与我一同前行吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi mo i 's sho ni do u ka na</span></p><p begin="02:37.295" end="02:40.722" itunes:key="L26">風が吹いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">微风轻拂后风车开始旋转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga fu i ta fu u sha ga ma wa 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:40.723" end="02:44.719" itunes:key="L27">風車が回った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风车转起来了</span></p><p begin="02:44.720" end="02:48.753" itunes:key="L28">ふいごが噴いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风箱运作后发出了阵阵轰鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i go ga fu i te ba ku o n ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:48.754" end="02:51.150" itunes:key="L29">爆音がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">响起了爆裂声</span></p><p begin="02:51.151" end="02:54.655" itunes:key="L30">酸素を吸った<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">氧气涌入胸腔后心跳如擂鼓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n so wo su 't ta ko do u ga hi bi i ta</span></p><p begin="02:54.656" end="02:58.493" itunes:key="L31">鼓動が響いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳在回响</span></p><p begin="02:58.494" end="03:06.574" itunes:key="L32">そうして何もかも動き始める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而后世间万物都似焕然新生般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u shi te na ni mo ka mo u go ki ha ji me ru</span></p><p begin="03:06.937" end="03:10.498" itunes:key="L33">長い夢だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点从这场长梦之中醒来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga i yu me da 't ta ha ya ku me za me te</span></p><p begin="03:10.499" end="03:14.332" itunes:key="L34">早く目覚めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快点让我醒来吧</span></p><p begin="03:14.333" end="03:18.575" itunes:key="L35">笑い飛ばしたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能笑对曾经过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i to ba shi ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:18.576" end="03:24.755" itunes:key="L36">さあ早くキスして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 快点亲吻我吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a ha ya ku ki su shi te</span></p><p begin="03:24.756" end="03:28.579" itunes:key="L37">ここから起こして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我从梦境中苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ka ra o ko shi te</span></p><p begin="03:28.580" end="03:34.872" itunes:key="L38">そんなおとぎ話にして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后将现实变为童话吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na o to gi ba na shi ni shi te</span></p><p begin="03:34.873" end="03:39.654" itunes:key="L39">ねえ王子様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 王子殿下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e o u ji sa ma</span></p><p begin="03:48.554" end="03:52.563" itunes:key="L40">心は孤独だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心是孤独的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha ko do ku da a i ha mi e na i</span></p><p begin="03:52.564" end="03:56.400" itunes:key="L41">愛は見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧看不见爱</span></p><p begin="03:56.401" end="04:04.115" itunes:key="L42">数値に出来ない感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份感情依然无法量化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su u chi ni de ki na i ka n jo u</span></p><p begin="04:04.116" end="04:07.922" itunes:key="L43">でも震えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可颤抖不停的脉搏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo fu ru e te i ru</span></p><p begin="04:07.923" end="04:11.634" itunes:key="L44">脈を打ち続ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍旧在不断地跃动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mya ku wo u chi tsu zu ke ru</span></p><p begin="04:11.635" end="04:21.869" itunes:key="L45">波に浮かぶ残骸のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同漂浮在海浪中的残骸般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi ni u ka bu za n ga i no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="04:22.942" end="04:26.754" itunes:key="L46">どうかそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托你留在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="04:26.755" end="04:30.387" itunes:key="L47">きみよそばに居て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请你留在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi yo so ba ni i te</span></p><p begin="04:30.388" end="04:34.215" itunes:key="L48">夢だっていいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕是梦也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me da 't te i i yo</span></p><p begin="04:34.216" end="04:40.990" itunes:key="L49">まだ目覚めてない振りして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会假装自己从来都不曾醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da me za me te na i fu ri shi te</span></p><p begin="04:40.991" end="04:44.827" itunes:key="L50">きみすら消えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你消失不见之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi su ra ki e te</span></p><p begin="04:44.828" end="04:48.777" itunes:key="L51">匂いも忘れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也忘记你的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i mo wa su re te</span></p><p begin="04:48.778" end="04:54.739" itunes:key="L52">世界に取り残さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要将我独自留在这个世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ni to ri no ko sa na i de</span></p><p begin="04:54.740" end="05:40.999" itunes:key="L53">どうか神様<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">求求你了神明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka ka mi sa ma</span></p></div></body></tt>